    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "DJA (David James Associates) is a London-based creative studio founded by David James in 1987, relaunched as DJA in 2011. Specialises in creative direction, brand identity, graphic design, packaging, and film for luxury and fashion clients (Prada, Louis Vuitton, Dior, Alexander McQueen, Loewe, Dunhill). David James spent nearly a decade as creative director at Prada (1996-2005) and a decade as CD at AnOther Magazine (2005-2015); he co-founded typeface studio Alias Foundry in 1996. Team size approximately 11-50 per LinkedIn; BoF 500 listed since 2013. Studio operates at a senior, director-led level with deep luxury sector expertise across three decades.",
